1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:13,859
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today, November eleventh: in Tokyo, you may soon walk through train ticket gates without touching anything at all. Let's listen.

2
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:23,675
